    "title": {
     "en": "The missing July"
    },
    "text": {
     "en": "Appa's new calendar had no July. How can they make the calendar for July 2024?"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "explain",
    "type": "explanation",
    "provenance": "original",
    "keepEnglishTerms": [
     "calendar",
     "month",
     "week",
     "July"
    ],
    "text": {
     "en": "A calendar shows days, weeks and months. A week has 7 days: Monday to Sunday.\nMake the July 2024 calendar. July 1 is a Monday. Then answer how many Sundays there are, and list the Thursdays.\nThree days after July 22, count 23, 24, 25, so it is July 25. Find the day too.\nIf a school closes on July 7 for 15 days, it reopens 15 days later, on July 22.\nA year has 12 months. Some months have 30 days and some have 31, and February has 28 or 29.\nCollect calendars of two years and compare the same month. You will see the days move."
    }
